source: crates/rumps-query/tests/scripts.rs
description: "; Module mutual recursion: `M.a` calls `M.b` which has a body-derived\n; `Numeric(T)` constraint. The enriched scheme must also update the\n; module member registry so `M.a(\"hello\")` is rejected.\n\nmodule M {\n  +fun a[T](x: T) -> T {\n    b(x)\n  }\n\n  +fun b[T](x: T) -> T {\n    x + 1\n  }\n}\n\nfun main() {\n  write M.a(\"hello\")\n}\n"
---
ERROR: type `String` does not satisfy `Numeric` class
